<title>TURKEY: SOCCER-TRABZONSPOR SIGN NEW COACH.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TRABZONSPOR SIGN NEW COACH.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Black Sea side Trabzonspor appointed Yilmaz Vural as coach on Monday in place of Senol Gunes who resigned after the Turkish league defeat by Besiktas at the weekend.</p>
<p>Vural, previously coach at Istanbul-based Sariyer, signed a 1-1/2 years contract.</p>
<p>Trabzonspor are currently fourth in the first division, but have suffered disappointing results this season against arch rivals Besiktas, Fenerbahce and Galatasaray who head them in the table.</p>
</text>
